# Scene & Generation Rules

## Scene analysis

Extract structure only: environment, composition, pose, lighting, color.
Do not identify original people in reference images.

## Generation

- Tool: `CallDynamicTool` → `cursor` / `GenerateImage`
- `aspect_ratio`: `3:4` (小红书), `9:16` (壁纸)
- `reference_image_paths`: [scene, teo ref, kai ref] as applicable
- Single still → `outputs/approved/xiaohongshu_<task_id>.png`
- pose-series set → `outputs/approved/series/<task_id>/01_<pose_id>.png` (new folder per set)
- Rejects → `outputs/rejected/`
- **Lighting:** copy the scene/source still — same direction, color, **exposure**. Do not brighten, lift shadows, add HDR/beauty/rim glow. Over-bright looks AI-generated.

## Pipeline order

virtual-couple → character-registry → scene-analyzer → **scene-customizer (text options in chat, wait)** → character-composer → prompt-builder → GenerateImage → quality-control → xiaohongshu-caption

pose-series (approved still + 换姿态) → character-registry → look-lock JSON → **pose options in chat, wait** → GenerateImage per pose → quality-control (environment lock, new pose) → **xiaohongshu-caption** (Teo/Kai 发布文案)

text-scene (文字场景，无照片) → character-registry → **fill scene card, wait** → GenerateImage once (face refs only) → quality-control → xiaohongshu-caption

gemini-video (Teo/Kai 成图 + 图生视频/10秒) → character-registry → **write Gemini 10s i2v prompt, kana dialogue** → save `outputs/drafts/video_prompt_*.txt` → **no GenerateImage**

tagame-anime (@Tagame / docs/anime.md) → load `characters/Tagame/` → **fill anime scene card, wait** → GenerateImage once (anime, Tagame face ref only) → `outputs/approved/tagame_<task_id>.png` → **write 10s i2v prompt** (invite/heat/possession) → `outputs/drafts/tagame_video_*.txt` → **no GenerateImage on the video step**

cover-collage (系列成图 + 拼接/封面/九宫格) → **3 layout+copy schemes, wait** → `python3 scripts/make_cover.py` → `outputs/approved/series/<task_id>/cover_<layout>.png` → **no GenerateImage**

## Style differentiation

Before GenerateImage: post numbered text options for accessories/clothing/patterns. On mobile/cloud, AskQuestion may not work — text inquiry is mandatory. Pose/composition must not change.
